Package: @PACKAGE@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, zlib1g, libgssapi-krb5-2, libssl3t64 | libssl3 | libssl1.1, libicu76 | libicu74 | libicu72 | libicu71 | libicu70 | libicu67, libfontconfig1, libice6, libsm6, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxrandr2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOMEPAGE@
Description: Manage achievements and statistics for Steam, GOG and Epic Games
 Achievement Caretaker shows your game library with a completion meter per game
 and opens a per-game window for achievements.
 .
  * Steam: unlock, lock and reset achievements and edit statistics. It talks to
    the Steam client directly by loading steamclient.so in process, so the Steam
    client must be installed, running and logged in. The library opens without
    it and shows the games saved last time.
  * GOG: unlock and lock achievements.
  * Epic Games: view the library and achievements (read-only).
 .
 GOG and Epic sign-in happens on the store's own page, inside the application;
 it never sees your password. Settings and saved libraries are kept in ~/.sac.
 Ubisoft Connect is Windows only and is not available in this package.
 .
 This package is self-contained: it bundles the .NET runtime and does not need
 dotnet-runtime-10.0 from Microsoft's repository.
 .
 Steam support is based on Steam Achievement Manager by Rick (gibbed), and is
 an altered source version of it. GOG support is based on GOG Achievements
 Manager by Timendum.
